{"id":"t5-jawi-kafa","tahap":"T5","nama":"Jawi (KAFA)","sk":"Jawi","ikon":"✍️","warna":"#B8862B","bahasa":"ms","kur":"KAFA Tahun 5 (ikut e-buku Jawi Tahun 5)","semak":"pending teacher review","jawi":true,"versi":"0.5.68","sumber":"Original notes and questions following the chapters of the owner's e-BOOK JAWI Tahun 5 (JAIS); Jawi examples in DBP spelling; shown in full Jawi.","topik":[{"id":"t5-jawi-kafa-1","nama":"Imbuhan selepas vokal","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Akhiran selepas vokal"},{"j":"p","t":"Apabila akhiran <span class=\"rm\">-an</span> ditambah kepada kata dasar yang berakhir dengan vokal <span class=\"rm\">a</span>, huruf <span class=\"arab\">ء</span> (hamzah) ditulis sebelum <span class=\"arab\">ن</span>: <span class=\"arab\">ءن</span>. Jika berakhir dengan <span class=\"rm\">u</span> atau <span class=\"rm\">o</span>, ditulis <span class=\"arab\">وان</span>."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">kepulauan</span> → <span class=\"arab\">كڤولاوان</span>","<span class=\"rm\">kicauan</span> → <span class=\"arab\">كيچاوان</span>","<span class=\"rm\">persetujuan</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ڤرستوجوان</span>","<span class=\"rm\">kelajuan</span> → <span class=\"arab\">كلاجوان</span>","<span class=\"rm\">perayaan</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ڤراياٴن</span>","<span class=\"rm\">keadaan</span> → <span class=\"arab\">كاداٴن</span>","<span class=\"rm\">kebersamaan</span> → <span class=\"arab\">كبرساماٴن</span>","<span class=\"rm\">pertemuan</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ڤرتموان</span>"]},{"j":"h","t":"Ingat"},{"j":"p","t":"Ejaan kata dasar dikekalkan: <span class=\"rm\">laju</span> → <span class=\"arab\">لاجو</span> menjadi <span class=\"rm\">kelajuan</span> → <span class=\"arab\">كلاجوان</span>."}],"glosari":[["Kata dasar","Perkataan asal tanpa imbuhan."],["Hamzah","Huruf <span class=\"arab\">ء</span>."]]},{"id":"t5-jawi-kafa-2","nama":"Akhiran -i","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Ejaan akhiran <span class=\"rm\">-i</span>"},{"j":"l","t":["Selepas konsonan: ditulis <span class=\"arab\">ي</span>, seperti <span class=\"rm\">sirami</span> → <span class=\"arab\">سيرامي</span>","Selepas vokal <span class=\"rm\">a</span>: ditulis <span class=\"arab\">ٴي</span>, seperti <span class=\"rm\">mencintai</span> → <span class=\"arab\">منچينتاٴي</span>","Selepas vokal <span class=\"rm\">u</span>: ditulis <span class=\"arab\">ءي</span>, seperti <span class=\"rm\">mengakui</span> → <span class=\"arab\">مڠاكوءي</span>"]},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">menemani</span> → <span class=\"arab\">منماني</span>","<span class=\"rm\">hajati</span> → <span class=\"arab\">حاجتي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">sirami</span> → <span class=\"arab\">سيرامي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">limpahi</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ليمڤهي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">jauhi</span> → <span class=\"arab\">جاٴوهي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">hampiri</span> → <span class=\"arab\">همڤيري</span>","<span class=\"rm\">mengakui</span> → <span class=\"arab\">مڠاكوءي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">mencintai</span> → <span class=\"arab\">منچينتاٴي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">dirindui</span> → <span class=\"arab\">دريندوءي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">menanyai</span> → <span class=\"arab\">منڽاٴي</span>"]}],"glosari":[["Akhiran","Imbuhan di belakang kata dasar."]]},{"id":"t5-jawi-kafa-3","nama":"Istilah agama","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Ejaan istilah agama"},{"j":"p","t":"Istilah agama yang berasal daripada bahasa Arab dieja mengikut ejaan asal bahasa Arab."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">tahajud</span> → <span class=\"arab\">تهجد</span>","<span class=\"rm\">amil</span> → <span class=\"arab\">عامل</span>","<span class=\"rm\">ulama</span> → <span class=\"arab\">علماء</span>","<span class=\"rm\">halal</span> → <span class=\"arab\">حلال</span>","<span class=\"rm\">sunnah</span> → <span class=\"arab\">سنة</span>","<span class=\"rm\">zakat</span> → <span class=\"arab\">زكاة</span>","<span class=\"rm\">istilah</span> → <span class=\"arab\">اصطلاح</span>","<span class=\"rm\">Isyak</span> → <span class=\"arab\">عشاء</span>","<span class=\"rm\">kiamat</span> → <span class=\"arab\">قيامة</span>","<span class=\"rm\">hadis</span> → <span class=\"arab\">حديث</span>","<span class=\"rm\">syariat</span> → <span class=\"arab\">شريعة</span>","<span class=\"rm\">rezeki</span> → <span class=\"arab\">رزقي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">khianat</span> → <span class=\"arab\">خيانت</span>","<span class=\"rm\">haram</span> → <span class=\"arab\">حرام</span>","<span class=\"rm\">zalim</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ظالم</span>"]},{"j":"h","t":"Ingat"},{"j":"p","t":"Kita menulis istilah agama dengan betul kerana ia berkaitan dengan al-Quran dan hadis."}],"glosari":[["Istilah","Perkataan khusus dalam sesuatu bidang."],["Ejaan asal","Ejaan seperti dalam bahasa Arab."]]},{"id":"t5-jawi-kafa-4","nama":"Kata pinjaman bahasa Inggeris","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Ejaan kata pinjaman"},{"j":"p","t":"Kata pinjaman daripada bahasa Inggeris dieja mengikut sebutan dalam bahasa Melayu, menggunakan huruf Jawi yang paling hampir dengan bunyinya. Huruf <span class=\"arab\">ۏ</span> digunakan untuk bunyi <span class=\"rm\">v</span>."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">grafik</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ݢرافيك</span>","<span class=\"rm\">idea</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ايديا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">organisasi</span> → <span class=\"arab\">اورݢانيساسي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">pasport</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ڤسڤورت</span>","<span class=\"rm\">bas</span> → <span class=\"arab\">بس</span>","<span class=\"rm\">van</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ۏن</span>","<span class=\"rm\">vaksin</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ۏاكسين</span>","<span class=\"rm\">epal</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ايڤل</span>","<span class=\"rm\">taktik</span> → <span class=\"arab\">تاكتيك</span>","<span class=\"rm\">basikal</span> → <span class=\"arab\">باسيكل</span>","<span class=\"rm\">radio</span> → <span class=\"arab\">راديو</span>","<span class=\"rm\">televisyen</span> → <span class=\"arab\">تيليۏيشن</span>"]}],"glosari":[["Kata pinjaman","Perkataan yang diambil daripada bahasa lain."],["Sebutan","Cara menyebut perkataan."]]},{"id":"t5-jawi-kafa-5","nama":"Singkatan dan akronim","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Singkatan"},{"j":"p","t":"{{Singkatan}} ialah bentuk ringkas yang disebut huruf demi huruf. Dalam Jawi, setiap huruf ditulis mengikut sebutannya dan dipisahkan dengan titik."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">KLCC</span> → <span class=\"arab\">كي.ايل.سي.سي</span>","<span class=\"rm\">HKL</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ايچ.كي.ايل</span>","<span class=\"rm\">SMS</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ايس.ايم.ايس</span>","<span class=\"rm\">VIP</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ۏي.اي.ڤي</span>"]},{"j":"h","t":"Akronim"},{"j":"p","t":"{{Akronim}} ialah singkatan yang disebut sebagai satu perkataan. Dalam Jawi, akronim dieja seperti perkataan biasa."},{"j":"l","t":["<span class=\"rm\">JAIS</span> → <span class=\"arab\">جاٴيس</span>","<span class=\"rm\">MAIS</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ماٴيس</span>","<span class=\"rm\">PETRONAS</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ڤيترونس</span>","<span class=\"rm\">MARA</span> → <span class=\"arab\">مارا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">TADIKA</span> → <span class=\"arab\">تاديكا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">PROTON</span> → <span class=\"arab\">ڤروتون</span>","<span class=\"rm\">FELDA</span> → <span class=\"arab\">فيلدا</span>","<span class=\"rm\">UNESCO</span> → <span class=\"arab\">يونيسكو</span>"]}],"glosari":[["Singkatan","Bentuk ringkas yang disebut huruf demi huruf."],["Akronim","Singkatan yang disebut sebagai satu perkataan."]]},{"id":"t5-jawi-kafa-6","nama":"Ulang kaji Jawi Tahun 5","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Ringkasan"},{"j":"l","t":["Akhiran <span class=\"rm\">-an</span> selepas vokal <span class=\"rm\">a</span>: <span class=\"arab\">ءن</span>","Akhiran <span class=\"rm\">-i</span> selepas vokal: <span class=\"arab\">ٴي / ءي</span>","Istilah agama dieja seperti bahasa Arab","Kata pinjaman dieja mengikut sebutan","Singkatan dipisahkan dengan titik; akronim dieja seperti perkataan"]}],"glosari":[["